  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://kastle-labl.org/lod/ontology/AgentRole">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://kastle-labl.org/lod/ontology/Name"/>
    <skos:editorialNote xml:lang="en">Axioms were lost when this pattern was harvested: the OWL API could not read part of the source and substituted placeholder classes in http://org.semanticweb.owlapi/error#, which asserted this class to be a subclass of Error1, Error2 and so on. The placeholders are removed here because they carry no information. What they stood for is still in the source: https://ontologydesignpatterns.org/wiki/Submissions:RoleDependentNames.</skos:editorialNote>
  </rdf:Description>
